l, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="padding: 0mm;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; line-height: 15pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">I am writing to confirm the Discounts for Domestic Mainline bookings that will be applied under the Corporate Airfares Agreement between Qantas and&nbsp;{!<span class="SpellE">Account.Legal_Name__c</span>}&nbsp;(“<b>Agreement</b>”). Unless otherwise specified, capitalised terms in this notice have the same meanings given in the Agreement.<br></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br></span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">{!<span class="SpellE">Account.Legal_Name__c</span>}&nbsp;achieved Qantas Market Share (Domestic) of 90% or above for 3 consecutive months.</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><o:p></o:p></span></p><ul type="disc" style="margin-bottom: 0mm;"><li class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 15pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Month 1 (<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">MM</span>): <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">XX</span>%</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; line-height: 15pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Month 2 (<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">MM</span>): <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">XX</span>%</span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 15pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Month 3 (<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">MM</span>): <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">XX</span>%</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; line-height: 15pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; line-height: 15pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">In accordance with Part C, clause 2 in Table 2 in the Agreement,&nbsp;{!<span class="SpellE">Account.Legal_Name__c</span>}’s Discounts&nbsp;for Domestic Mainline bookings will move from Tier 1 to Tier  2 effective&nbsp;<b><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 102);">DDMMMYYY</span></b>.</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br><br></span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Please feel free to reach out with any questions or concerns.</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br><br></span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Kind regards,</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br><br></span><b><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">{!<span class="SpellE">User.FirstName</span>}</span></b><b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br></span></b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><br></span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rg